            "body": "<p><strong>Option one:</strong> close this, keep getting asked about your sleep, keep angling the laptop, keep letting your face brief the room before you have said anything. That is a choice — it just doesn’t feel like one, which is exactly why it’s lasted this long.</p><p><strong>Option two:</strong> eight weeks, two nights a week. Find out what your face says about you when something actually reaches the skin. If it changes nothing, you get your money back and you are out the eight weeks.</p>"
